    {
      "claim": "Direct human absolute F values for lipophilic, poorly soluble reference molecules exceed 20%: vismodegib 31.8%, erlotinib 59%, celecoxib 22–40%, and bosentan ~50%. This supports that the query's high lipophilicity and predicted poor solubility do not affirmatively imply F < 20%.",
