      "claim": "L4 solubility/dissolution records show vismodegib (FASSIF 3 µg/mL; aqueous 0.4–1 µg/mL at pH 6.5–7) and erlotinib (free-base 7.2 µg/mL at pH 6.5; DE10 11.6%, DE60 31%) still achieve F ≥ 20%, so low solubility/dissolution is not threshold-negative.",
